  "term_and_condition": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Welcome to AllergyStore.Com! Thanks for\r\njoining our Ambassador program.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">These following terms and conditions apply to\r\nindividuals who are accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (“we” or\r\n“merchant”) and an ambassador (“you” or “ambassador”) who refers customers to\r\nuse product or service from the merchant.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">By participating in the Program, Ambassador\r\nagrees to use the Program in the manner specified in, and are bound by, these\r\nTerms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms and Conditions in\r\ntheir entirety you are not authorized to register as an Ambassador or\r\nparticipate in the Program in any manner.</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>1. Approve or Reject of the Registration</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">We reserve the right to approve or reject ANY Ambassador\r\nProgram Registration in our sole and absolute discretion. You will have no\r\nlegal recourse against us for the rejection of your Ambassador Program\r\nRegistration.</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>2. Ambassador Links and Coupon</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">An ambassador link is automatically generated,\r\nbut you can also generate an ambassador link for a specific product or\r\ncollection. If a person clicks on someone else’s referral link and then later\r\nthey click on yours, yours is the one that counts.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">An ambassador might or might not be assigned\r\nto one coupon code with details and usage clarified on the&nbsp;Dashboard.\r\nIf a customer clicks on the ambassador link and use coupon code, you will not\r\nreceive a double commission. If you’re not assigned a branded coupon, then\r\nyou’re not allowed to promote the coupon.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">The ambassador may also advertise merchant\r\nwebsite on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">At no time is the ambassador to advertise or\r\npromote their link on: <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Amazon<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Walmart<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Ebay;<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">or 3rd party channel<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">or use in any Pay Per Click (PPC) advertising campaigns using any of the following terms:</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">AllergyStore.Com</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Allergy Store</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Allergystore</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The Allergy Store</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The ambassador link may be used on offline\r\nclassified channel ads, magazines, and newspapers.<br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>3. Commissions and payment</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Refer any customer to make a purchase on our\r\nwebsite, you will get a commission amount which is calculated based on\r\nCommission structure. <b>Ambassadors will not receive commissions on products/orders placed for personal use.</b> Commission amount is dependent on order value and not\r\nincluding extra fees (tax, shipping cost,).<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">For an Ambassador to receive a commission, you\r\nneed to specify the payment details on Settings. A payment schedule will be\r\nnotified on the Ambassador Guide page.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Payments will only be sent for transactions\r\nthat have been successfully completed. The use of the Ambassador Program is subject\r\nto a fair use policy that gives the merchant the right to review each and every\r\nreferral order. </font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Status of commission if displayed in the Commission tab, any\r\npaid commission will be listed on the Payment tab. </font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Commissions on transactions that result in\r\nchargebacks or refunds will not be paid out. If a commission has been paid on\r\nan item/order that is later returned, the commission paid will be deducted from\r\nthe next commission payout.</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>4. Marketing tool</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">We may share promotion media such as banner,\r\nlogo or specific collection promotion to you through the Marketing tool tab.\r\nYou can download the media or get the HTML embed code in order to share it on an ambassador\r\nchannels.</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>5. Network</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">If the Network tab is activated, the ambassador\r\ncan invite others to become their downline ambassador. If any downline</font></span> ambassador brings order to merchant shop, upline ambassador will also get network commission which depends on merchant settings.\r\n\r\nTo invite other ambassadors into the system, share network link and any other ambassador who click on that link and sign up will become a downline ambassador.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 7.5pt; color: rgb(103, 106, 108); font-family: \" open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 13px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" start;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" line-height:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>6. Cookie</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">We use a cookie to track people who have\r\nclicked on your link, so they need to be using cookies for us to track them.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">If a person doesn't allow cookies or clears\r\ntheir cookies then we can't track them so we can't pay earnings on that\r\nperson's activity.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">Cookies day is said on the Ambassador\r\nregistration form. The tracking day will start from the time a customer clicks\r\non the ambassador’s link or use the coupon. Within the cookie time, every order\r\nmade by this customer at the merchant website will automatically result in\r\ncommissions to the ambassador (There’s no need for the customer to click on the\r\nambassador link then).</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>7. Removal from Referral Program</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">If an ambassador wishes to be removed from the\r\nambassador program, they can do so by contacting:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:mike@allergystore.com\">mike@allergystore.com</a>.</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Go forward and refer!</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\">We're very glad you've made it to the end of\r\nthis important document.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p 